{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:37:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_64a54772e7504b60ae16728eae685832","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_05fd5985ce77a9020d4792441f2ce373e8f1cea26246a0fdfd5c4529db737be3","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=dependencies","setting":"bauer-jan/stock-analysis-with-llm@96b8039f7b24 snapshot 5d2b26a1fe4cc741","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_127b0ce46a46c8c4f5b83110f6e045dde7feaca8533ad57bf481644ab37d3a1e","slc_9a56c9b957b7be97c37eb12c57ac759eb0534864518b8f288a4f39b27f9af18a","slc_f0242bfb0b79db0c2223a649c32d46b821c7172bfa80c1e941660b5aa08f919f","slc_fb5debac34041b5db04b8f7a131ce016bf8f717aeac0377a66ea383b8f8abbe4"],"source_ids":["src_c482279844cb55f484a8e0644dd5fe9a"],"text":"The system depends on AWS services (EventBridge, ECS, Bedrock, DynamoDB, Lambda, CDK) and the Yahoo Finance API, and requires Anthropic Claude 3 model access enabled in the Bedrock console.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:37:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_64a54772e7504b60ae16728eae685832"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:37:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_64a54772e7504b60ae16728eae685832","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_13432828e7dbc90d04592b5b2cd27e127a85dcdd3e77badc2ab858dabcdc4c75","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"bauer-jan/stock-analysis-with-llm@96b8039f7b24 snapshot 5d2b26a1fe4cc741","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_80a6b3d27318cc08ae786eeca5bc734cd6d5f7a7fceb2d879aeb0b2530394ca0"],"source_ids":["src_c482279844cb55f484a8e0644dd5fe9a"],"text":"A Portfolio Manager module updates the portfolio weekly based on analyst BUY/SELL recommendations and market sentiment, accepts user prompts to influence selection and weighting, and stores the portfolio in a database.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:37:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_64a54772e7504b60ae16728eae685832"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:37:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_64a54772e7504b60ae16728eae685832","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_23761bd24a1bdf07a31dd8e994afc8ad193e772a44641ba10e104c7c457b5bed","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=components","setting":"bauer-jan/stock-analysis-with-llm@96b8039f7b24 snapshot 5d2b26a1fe4cc741","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_9a8fee0b075d621b9df5619ed4fca6e0e97020605c916879807c3a44346c3e5c"],"source_ids":["src_c482279844cb55f484a8e0644dd5fe9a"],"text":"A Stock Analyst module performs weekly analysis of S&P 500, Nasdaq 100 and EURO STOXX 50 stocks, ranks them within their industries using balance sheet data, technical indicators and news, and stores results in a database.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:37:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_64a54772e7504b60ae16728eae685832"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:37:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_64a54772e7504b60ae16728eae685832","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_34b35ecac0826dc527af21fcd1dd434ae2019264ceb7baa4faca14ef8c8c00b6","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=specifications","setting":"bauer-jan/stock-analysis-with-llm@96b8039f7b24 snapshot 5d2b26a1fe4cc741","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_fd13a38e17edfd3ddb8d73c089f5b80f73ca546796a57181a6011656b9ea2036"],"source_ids":["src_c482279844cb55f484a8e0644dd5fe9a"],"text":"The project aims to build an automated stock analysis and portfolio management system using balance sheet data, technical indicators, news, industry information and market sentiment, powered by LLMs such as Claude 3 on AWS Bedrock.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:37:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_64a54772e7504b60ae16728eae685832"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:37:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_64a54772e7504b60ae16728eae685832","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_7e46f06dd23e17e63d7b4c41d8570c52e5cd457cfc963255ae4f35dd196a0142","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=interfaces","setting":"bauer-jan/stock-analysis-with-llm@96b8039f7b24 snapshot 5d2b26a1fe4cc741","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_348be2049c55294b5917d704ebd762508f0a383cc04851ac96d6032a25025634","slc_36a5cf0e870ec67f95cc27e5106641332317661c99e77886e02e4fd9f59e9f91","slc_7387495f0f4096ceb39c3d26796d6e9182db2933b7024a707ffc7ef5f4b07b04"],"source_ids":["src_c482279844cb55f484a8e0644dd5fe9a"],"text":"Behavior is configured via src/config.ini, e.g. setting COMPARE_SYMBOLS_WITHOUT_INDUSTRY, INDEX_SYMBOLS and SYMBOLS to compare individual stocks or rank all stocks in an index by industry.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:37:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_64a54772e7504b60ae16728eae685832"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:37:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_64a54772e7504b60ae16728eae685832","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_871f069517a5411e9440e4279a34cefdab75acaad11e490fe76fa0557a99e752","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=memory-state","setting":"bauer-jan/stock-analysis-with-llm@96b8039f7b24 snapshot 5d2b26a1fe4cc741","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_127b0ce46a46c8c4f5b83110f6e045dde7feaca8533ad57bf481644ab37d3a1e"],"source_ids":["src_c482279844cb55f484a8e0644dd5fe9a"],"text":"LLM recommendations and summarized data are saved in Amazon DynamoDB.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:37:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_64a54772e7504b60ae16728eae685832"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:37:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_64a54772e7504b60ae16728eae685832","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_90329ab9305aa9ffc41de1c695227587d77d1372aa13c02ed6ac79531ad46a57","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"bauer-jan/stock-analysis-with-llm@96b8039f7b24 snapshot 5d2b26a1fe4cc741","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_127b0ce46a46c8c4f5b83110f6e045dde7feaca8533ad57bf481644ab37d3a1e"],"source_ids":["src_c482279844cb55f484a8e0644dd5fe9a"],"text":"Portfolio management is separately triggered by an EventBridge event; a Bedrock Agent collects general market news, and the LLM acts as portfolio manager using analyst-provided information.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:37:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_64a54772e7504b60ae16728eae685832"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:37:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_64a54772e7504b60ae16728eae685832","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9a80d7085e6796b01e6a5ae3498bda2b86106fb7e96e4f8537af168b561524c8","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=limitations","setting":"bauer-jan/stock-analysis-with-llm@96b8039f7b24 snapshot 5d2b26a1fe4cc741","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_51e47883c8ac5dacb3678df1f29d1bd58557cc5ed2c8a9c38e2a4b5eb0afb7ae"],"source_ids":["src_c482279844cb55f484a8e0644dd5fe9a"],"text":"Comparing all stocks within indexes can incur high Bedrock costs due to the large number of stocks involved.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:37:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_64a54772e7504b60ae16728eae685832"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:37:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_64a54772e7504b60ae16728eae685832","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9c73abf3364eb0e0621bf0c5764b9d48faf211bded3847bec7ac88c62641bb68","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=workflows","setting":"bauer-jan/stock-analysis-with-llm@96b8039f7b24 snapshot 5d2b26a1fe4cc741","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_866c013ad66beb41e5221f8165df4b16b6c7b0eee013131e31ab3e911bb75fd3","slc_9a56c9b957b7be97c37eb12c57ac759eb0534864518b8f288a4f39b27f9af18a","slc_b7d08ac67f823a721efc4e23d31b699fba04c6ff2980e9bcdbeb03b35204ee95","slc_f0242bfb0b79db0c2223a649c32d46b821c7172bfa80c1e941660b5aa08f919f"],"source_ids":["src_c482279844cb55f484a8e0644dd5fe9a"],"text":"Repository development practice: setup involves deploying infrastructure with 'cdk deploy', running infrastructure/deploy_agents.py to create Bedrock Agents (not CDK-supported), manually configuring action groups and prompt templates in the console, and updating src/config.ini before redeploying.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:37:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_64a54772e7504b60ae16728eae685832"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:37:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_64a54772e7504b60ae16728eae685832","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_9e61eebdb2c705794a9e78a2904d90bb197b3c0d8721e9791f714fa80aa98415","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=orchestration","setting":"bauer-jan/stock-analysis-with-llm@96b8039f7b24 snapshot 5d2b26a1fe4cc741","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_127b0ce46a46c8c4f5b83110f6e045dde7feaca8533ad57bf481644ab37d3a1e"],"source_ids":["src_c482279844cb55f484a8e0644dd5fe9a"],"text":"The pipeline is triggered by AWS EventBridge events that start ECS tasks fetching earnings reports from Yahoo Finance, then prompts a Bedrock Agent for web searches and news summarization before Claude ranks stocks.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:37:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_64a54772e7504b60ae16728eae685832"}
{"access":"public","created_at":"2026-09-14T03:37:12Z","created_by_operation":"op_64a54772e7504b60ae16728eae685832","evidence_type":"organizational_statement","extraction_confidence":0.8,"id":"clm_a0b9b288517aa973a1ddf2198d3bba8e08e9072a5d69d9535c3478ac7d40d7de","lineage_status":"original_available","polarity":"affirmed","record_type":"claim","review_state":"mechanically_checked","schema_version":"1.0","scope":{"instrument_status":null,"jurisdiction":null,"method":"documented","population":null,"qualifiers":"kind=observation; facet=design-choices","setting":"bauer-jan/stock-analysis-with-llm@96b8039f7b24 snapshot 5d2b26a1fe4cc741","timeframe":null},"slice_ids":["slc_2d81cadfd0290b6432c0c6a03101ae624559a8126bb66489c474a52b54c5d8de","slc_9a56c9b957b7be97c37eb12c57ac759eb0534864518b8f288a4f39b27f9af18a"],"source_ids":["src_c482279844cb55f484a8e0644dd5fe9a"],"text":"Prompt templates are externalized in src/schema/prompts.yaml so model behavior can be tuned by editing prompts; an internet-search action group schema is provided at src/schema/internet-search-schema.json.","updated_at":"2026-09-14T03:37:12Z","updated_by_operation":"op_64a54772e7504b60ae16728eae685832"}
